<title>POLAND: Stalexport to issue PLN 40 mln CPs.</title>
<headline>Stalexport to issue PLN 40 mln CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Development Bank (PBR) will lead steel trader Stalexport SA's issue of 40 million zlotys commercial paper, Stalexport said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Stalexport said the agreement was signed on Monday.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
